{"schema":1,"kind":"models","generated_at":"2026-11-28T17:40:19Z","models":[{"id":"epa","label":"EPA","short_description":"Statbotics EPA, reproduced exactly: points a team adds per match.","how_it_works":["EPA (expected points added) estimates the points a team adds to its alliance's score in a typical match. It also rates each scoring component (auto, teleop, endgame and the season's game pieces) and each ranking point. This is the Statbotics model, run unchanged.","A team's season starts from its last two seasons: 70% of last season's normalized EPA and 30% of the season before, then 40% of the way back to the new-team level (1450, i.e. 0.2 SD below the 1500 mean). New teams start at that level.","After each match the alliance's error (actual minus predicted, per component) is split equally among its three teams, and each rating moves part of the way toward its share: 33.3% of the error through a team's first 6 qual matches, 26.7% at 9 and 20% from 12 on. Playoff matches count 0.33 as much and do not change ranking-point ratings.","A match prediction adds the three teams' ratings on each alliance. Win probability = 1 / (1 + 10^(k × (red − blue) / score SD)) with k = -0.625 and the season's score SD; the predicted scores then add the season's average foul points.","Ranking points: each alliance's summed RP rating goes through a sigmoid centred on 0.5 to give a probability. Season rules: in 2023 a grid row holds at most 9 pieces (overflow moves down a row); in 2025 a processor algae counts 6 points for you and 3 for the opponent's net.","Normalized EPA rescales a season's ratings to mean 1500, SD 250, so seasons compare. Season constants (means, score SD, foul rate) come from week 1, including the week-1 matches being predicted."],"constants":{"NORM_MEAN":{"value":1500,"meaning":"Normalized EPA mean (unitless)"},"NORM_SD":{"value":250,"meaning":"Normalized EPA standard deviation (unitless)"},"INIT_PENALTY":{"value":0.2,"meaning":"New teams start this many SD below the mean"},"YEAR_ONE_WEIGHT":{"value":0.7,"meaning":"Weight of last season in the starting rating (the season before gets the rest)"},"MEAN_REVERSION":{"value":0.4,"meaning":"Share of the starting rating pulled back to the new-team level"},"ELIM_WEIGHT":{"value":0.3333333333333333,"meaning":"Weight of a playoff match update relative to a qual match"},"k":{"value":-0.625,"meaning":"Win probability = 1 / (1 + 10^(k * (red - blue) / score_sd))"},"percent_0":{"value":0.3333333333333333,"meaning":"Update step after 0 counted qual matches (share of the error)"},"percent_6":{"value":0.3333333333333333,"meaning":"Update step after 6 counted qual matches (share of the error)"},"percent_9":{"value":0.26666666666666666,"meaning":"Update step after 9 counted qual matches (share of the error)"},"percent_12":{"value":0.19999999999999998,"meaning":"Update step after 12 counted qual matches (share of the error)"}},"settings":{},"source":"Statbotics backend (MIT), avgupta456/statbotics @ a2cea55, src/models/epa","config_hash":""},{"id":"fast","label":"Fast EPA","short_description":"EPA with faster early-season updates and per-robot credit where TBA reports it.","how_it_works":["Fast EPA is a PitWall variant of EPA. It predicts matches the same way (same sums, sigmoids and season rules) but moves ratings faster early in a season and can credit points a single robot earned to that robot.","Update step: 51.7% of the error, falling to 28.7% over 9 matches from match 3. Playoff matches count 0.50 as much.","Where TBA reports a field per robot (for example leave, park or climb), that robot gets its own points and error; the rest of the alliance error is split by predicted share. Without per-robot data the error is split equally, as in EPA.","Starting ratings come from normalized EPA, as in EPA; win probability uses k = -0.75.","Settings were tuned on 2022, 2023, 2024 (win-probability Brier score) and frozen; later seasons are out-of-sample checks."],"constants":{"percent_first_n":{"value":0,"meaning":"Qual matches that use the first-match step"},"percent_first":{"value":0.5175,"meaning":"Update step for those first matches (share of the error)"},"percent_start":{"value":0.5175,"meaning":"Update step at the start of the ramp"},"percent_end":{"value":0.2875,"meaning":"Update step after the ramp"},"percent_ramp_start":{"value":3,"meaning":"Qual match count where the ramp starts"},"percent_ramp_len":{"value":9,"meaning":"Qual matches the ramp takes"},"elim_weight":{"value":0.5,"meaning":"Weight of a playoff match update relative to a qual match"},"mean_reversion":{"value":0.3,"meaning":"Share of the starting rating pulled back to the new-team level"},"year_one_weight":{"value":0.7,"meaning":"Weight of last season in the starting rating"},"robot_weight":{"value":1.0,"meaning":"Weight of per-robot attribution against the equal split"},"k":{"value":-0.75,"meaning":"Win probability = 1 / (1 + 10^(k * (red - blue) / score_sd))"},"NORM_MEAN":{"value":1500,"meaning":"Normalized EPA mean (unitless)"},"NORM_SD":{"value":250,"meaning":"Normalized EPA standard deviation (unitless)"}},"settings":{"percent":{"first_n":0,"first":0.5175,"start":0.5175,"end":0.2875,"ramp_start":3,"ramp_len":9},"elim_weight":0.5,"mean_reversion":0.3,"year_one_weight":0.7,"seed":"norm_epa","robot_attribution":true,"robot_weight":1.0,"residual_split":"share","passback":{"enabled":false,"percent_scale":0.5,"scope":"quals"},"win_k":-0.75},"source":"PitWall pipeline/sb/fast_epa.py, config pipeline/models/fast_epa.json","config_hash":"0b9496add840ce99db3789b8709e8a9269a658df3733b1f04959f94ff00508b6","tuning":{"tuned_on":[2022,2023,2024],"tuned_at":"2026-11-16T03:49:09Z","objective":"mean over tuning seasons of win-prob Brier (all scored matches); tie-break mean score MAE","search":{"method":"one-pass coordinate search from the EPA-equivalent point, then one dampening refinement, then win_k by exact remapping","configs_tried":24,"coordinates":["robot_attribution","residual_split","robot_weight